{
  "id": "02",
  "title": "快速上手",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1) 0%, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05) 100%); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 48px; border-radius: 8px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading);\">在 5 分鐘內開始使用 Gravito。建立您的第一個路由、控制器，並了解框架提供的三種渲染路徑。</p></div><h2>安裝</h2><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><path d=\"M21 10V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 18v-8z\"></path><polyline points=\"3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"22.08\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">獨立 Photon</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">適用於輕量級應用程式，直接安裝 Photon：</p><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code>bun add @gravito/photon</code></pre></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">完整框架</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">適用於生產環境，包含完整生態系統：</p><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code>bun add @gravito/core</code></pre></div></div><h2>第一個路由</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">路由定義在 <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;\">src/routes/web.ts</code>（或 <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;\">api.ts</code>）。API 設計簡潔且支援鏈式調用。</p><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 24px 0;\"><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">獨立 Photon</h3><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code>import { Photon } from '@gravito/photon'\n\nconst app = new Photon()\n\napp.get('/', (c) => {\n  return c.json({ \n    status: 'accelerating', \n    version: '1.2.0' \n  })\n})\n\nBun.serve({\n  port: 3000,\n  fetch: app.fetch\n})</code></pre></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 24px 0;\"><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">使用 PlanetCore</h3><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code>import { Route } from '@gravito/core'\n\nRoute.get('/hello', () => 'Hello Gravito!')</code></pre></div><h2>使用控制器</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">當邏輯變得複雜時，將其移至控制器以獲得更好的組織結構。使用 CLI 生成一個：</p><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px;\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"></polyline><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"13\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"17\"></line><polyline points=\"10 9 9 9 8 9\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">步驟 1：生成控制器</h3></div><pre style=\"margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code>bun gravito make:controller UserController</code></pre><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px;\"><polyline points=\"16 18 22 12 16 6\"></polyline><polyline points=\"8 6 2 12 8 18\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">步驟 2：定義處理器</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">在 <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;\">src/controllers/UserController.ts</code> 中：</p><pre style=\"margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code>import { Context } from '@gravito/core'\n\nexport class UserController {\n  async index(c: Context) {\n    return c.json({ message: '這是來自控制器的回應' })\n  }\n}</code></pre><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px;\"><path d=\"M9 11l3 3L22 4\"></path><path d=\"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11\"></path></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">步驟 3：註冊路由</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">在 <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;\">src/routes/web.ts</code> 中：</p><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code>import { UserController } from '../controllers/UserController'\n\nRoute.get('/users', [UserController, 'index'])</code></pre></div><h2>三種渲染路徑</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">Gravito 允許您為每個頁面切換模式，為每個用例提供最佳方法：</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">A</div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">全端 SPA</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">Inertia.js + React/Vue，適用於複雜的儀表板和後台管理面板。</p><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px;\"><code>index(c: Context) {\n  const inertia = c.get('inertia')\n  return inertia.render('UserProfile', { \n    name: 'John Doe' \n  })\n}</code></pre></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">B</div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">傳統 MPA</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">模板引擎，適用於 SEO 友好的頁面、部落格和登錄頁面。</p><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px;\"><code>index(c: Context) {\n  const view = c.get('view')\n  return view.render('welcome', { \n    title: '我的網站' \n  })\n}</code></pre></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">C</div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">純 API</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">輕量級微服務，適用於純 API 後端和行動應用程式。</p><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px;\"><code>index(c: Context) {\n  return c.json({ status: 'ok' })\n}</code></pre></div></div><h2>資料庫與遷移</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">Gravito 內建 <strong>Atlas ORM</strong>，提供強大的資料庫操作：</p><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M21 12c0 1.66-4 3-9 3s-9-1.34-9-3\"></path><path d=\"M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5\"></path></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">執行遷移</h3></div><pre style=\"margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code># 執行所有待處理的遷移\nbun gravito migrate\n\n# 建立新的遷移\nbun gravito make:migration create_posts_table</code></pre><div style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading);\">提示：</strong> 查看 <a href=\"/docs/atlas\" style=\"color: #FFB800; text-decoration: underline;\">Atlas ORM 文檔</a> 以了解完整的資料庫操作、關聯和查詢建構器用法。</p></div></div><h2>互動式 REPL (Tinker)</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">使用內建的 REPL 互動式測試您的應用程式：</p><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 24px 0;\"><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px;\"><code>bun gravito tinker</code></pre><p style=\"margin: 16px 0 0 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">這會開啟一個互動式 shell，您可以在其中測試路由、查詢資料庫並實驗應用程式邏輯。</p></div><h2>下一步</h2><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; transition: all 0.2s ease; cursor: pointer;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px; color: #FFB800;\"><path d=\"M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z\"></path><path d=\"M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z\"></path></svg><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">核心概念</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">深入了解 Gravito 的架構和設計模式。</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; transition: all 0.2s ease; cursor: pointer;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px; color: #FFB800;\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">路由系統</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">探索進階路由模式和中介軟體。</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; transition: all 0.2s ease; cursor: pointer;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px; color: #FFB800;\"><path d=\"M21 10V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 18v-8z\"></path><polyline points=\"3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"22.08\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line></svg><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">專案結構</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">了解如何組織您的 Gravito 應用程式。</p></div></div>",
  "meta": {
    "lastUpdated": "2026-01-15",
